{"body":{"model":"haiku","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"outside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CQ"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DB"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-14"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much direction a whole may give its parts before their autonomy is spent","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DA"}],"prose":"The whole is a field of wholes inside wholes, where each part keeps its own footing while a higher whole gives it a direction. The same lending of direction recurs at every depth of the held paper, from the frame down to the sentences.","title":"A field of nested wholes"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the rate at which authority falls off as one descends the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"}],"prose":"Wholes are recursively nested, and the higher a whole sits the more it may decide, while lower wholes execute within their local latitude. The paper contrasts this pyramid with a looser distribution of authority, and the contrast is a claim about where decisions live.","title":"Depth and falling authority"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which capability a holon is for, rather than what it is made of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"The added dimensions are less kinds of thing than roles a holon can take on, each answering a lack the authors find in autonomous systems. Ethics, effectiveness, understanding, freedom from bias and vigilance are set beside one another and cross-wired into a recursive whole.","title":"Five capacities a holon wears"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon and range of consequence that count in a decision","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"}],"prose":"An effective holon is distinguished from an efficient one by the breadth and length of the consequences it weighs, including environment, society and long-run performance. Efficiency optimises a short window; effectiveness widens it.","title":"Effective holon and the horizon of consequence"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether ethics is a hard constraint or merely one weight among others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"}],"prose":"The ethical holon is pictured as operating within encoded guidelines, so that moral limits are evaluated alongside operational goals instead of being traded against them. Safety, legality and harm-minimisation are the named anchors, with vehicles and healthcare as examples.","title":"Ethical holon as bounded constraint"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the richness of representation held against the effort of keeping it current","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"An understanding holon is a holon whose strength lies in holding structured knowledge, through ontologies and semantic inference, so that heterogeneous data becomes situational meaning. Its pull is toward richer representation and the cost that comes with it.","title":"Understanding holon and carried meaning"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where bias enters the loop and whether it is checked there continuously","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as a recurring pattern that can be catalogued, constrained and audited inside the decision loop, rather than as a one-off defect. The unbiased holon is the place where such checks and fairness constraints live.","title":"Unbiased holon and bias as a watched pattern"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether awareness is pooled across levels or stays local to each holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Vigilance is the shared awareness that lets local holons stay aligned with the whole, through distributed sensing and cross-level dissemination. Without it, parts are informed locally yet misaligned globally.","title":"Vigilant holon and shared awareness"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much shared meaning must exist in advance before two wholes can speak","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"Wholes built by different hands must still meet, and the paper holds that they meet by runtime mediation rather than a shared model or fixed standard. Binding is negotiated when needed, with a mediating holon carrying the meaning across.","title":"Federated binding across heterogeneous wholes"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the binding holon acts on others versus only mediating between them","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"}],"prose":"A single holon is proposed to hold the binding role: it translates, aligns goals, arbitrates among partial conflicts and reconfigures workflows, while leaving the internal logic of other holons alone. It sits above the rest as the place where federation is coordinated.","title":"The federated interoperability holon"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which functions are kept, and whether connection or only execution is controlled","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The binding holon is decomposed into an orchestrator, an integrator that records what each element can do, a translator, a finder, and generators and executors of workflows. Some of these can be left out, leaving the holon with control over execution alone and not over connection.","title":"Parts inside the binding holon"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning, from a single exchange to a standing vocabulary","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"}],"prose":"Meaning is made disposable: an ontology is built for a single exchange, phase or episode, used, and then discarded or revised. Version tracking and mapping rules keep successive short-lived states coherent with one another.","title":"Short-lived ontologies as temporary contracts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which barrier sits where, and which of the three alignment approaches is chosen","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Interoperability is broken into barriers of concept, organisation and technology, and into integrated, unified and federated approaches. The paper places its own contribution on the conceptual and organisational side, treating technical links as an assumed layer.","title":"Barriers and the three ways to align"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between what present systems fail at and what a holonic frame promises to close","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"The motive is a set of stubborn limits in current autonomous systems: brittle adaptation, bias, weak accountability and thin shared awareness. The authors read digital twins and learned models as an opening, and holonic structure as the frame that could hold them.","title":"Why the holon idea is pressed now"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the simulated entities are also the ones directing the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"}],"prose":"The simulation is not only a stage on which holons act; the holons also set and adjust how the simulation runs. The paper sorts this into degrees, from holons that only feed data to ones that rewrite the rules.","title":"Simulation whose entities also steer"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree to which holons decide the simulation's execution rather than just take part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"Holon-directed simulation is ordered along a line from passive data sources through reactive and adaptive holons to proactive ones that change objectives. The ordering is offered as a typology of how much a holon may decide about the simulation's own execution.","title":"Degrees of holon direction"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the rehearsal mirrors live operation closely enough to be trusted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The architecture is rehearsed inside a High Level Architecture federation, where federates stand in for holons and a federation manager reports discrepancies back up. The simulation is meant to test the system and to feed its strategies forward over repeated runs.","title":"The HLA federation as rehearsal"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the sparse, dispersed demand that the architecture must fit","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"A dispersed countryside with thin transport serves as the single worked setting, where the holonic architecture is asked to find transit deserts and coordinate scattered services. It shows the frame applied rather than proven.","title":"A rural mobility whole held as the test case"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the ordering of request, response, monitoring and validation within each pass","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The mobility system is run as a repeating cycle in which traveller requests meet routing and pricing responses, infrastructure monitoring feeds in, a communication holon translates across organisations, and routes are validated before they return to the user. Metadata about services accumulates in a graph that speeds later lookups.","title":"The mobility loop from request to route"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between asserted benefit and demonstrated result","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Several claims outrun evidence: the value of the dimensions is argued rather than measured, the mobility case is not a validation study, and many implementation hurdles are named but not met. The held space carries these as open edges beside the proposals.","title":"What the paper leaves unproven"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the asserted gains are tied to indicators that have actually been read","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"The discussion reads the framework as scalable, flexible, equitable and environmentally kinder, and reaches these as properties of the design rather than as measured outcomes. The metrics named for evaluation are travel time, emissions and service access, not yet reported.","title":"Claimed gains in fairness, scale and emissions"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}